---
layout: layout.liquid
title: Jeff Odell - Solo Acoustic Guitar
---
<div class='max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-4'>
  <div class='bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/80 to-stone-100/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6 shadow-lg border border-amber-200/50'>
    <h2 class='text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-amber-900'>Welcome!</h2>
    Jeff brings unique arrangements to the music you know and love. Engaging
    stage presence, professional appearance, and equipment ensure a solid
    performance for your establishment, party, or event.
    <ul class='space-y-3'></ul>
  </div>

  <div class='bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/80 to-stone-100/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6 shadow-lg border border-amber-200/50'>
    <h2 class='text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-amber-900'>
      I would love to hear from you!
    </h2>
    <ul class='list-disc pl-6 space-y-1'>
      <li>
        Email:
        <a
          href='mailto:jeff@odellmail.com'
          class='text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900'
          >jeff@odellmail.com</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        Mobile:
        <a href='tel:813-335-6966' class='text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900'
          >813-335-6966</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' class='inline-block w-4 h-4 mr-2 align-text-bottom fill-current text-amber-700' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'><path d='M22.675 0h-21.35C.596 0 0 .596 0 1.326v21.348C0 23.404.596 24 1.326 24h11.495v-9.294H9.691V11.01h3.13V8.414c0-3.1 1.893-4.788 4.659-4.788 1.325 0 2.463.098 2.795.142v3.24l-1.918.001c-1.504 0-1.794.715-1.794 1.764v2.313h3.587l-.467 3.696h-3.12V24h6.116C23.404 24 24 23.404 24 22.674V1.326C24 .596 23.404 0 22.675 0z'/></svg>
        Follow our Band on Facebook:
        <a
          href='https://www.facebook.com/ootbmusiclive/'
          class='text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900'
          >Out of the Blue</a
        >
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class='bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/80 to-stone-100/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg p-6 shadow-lg border border-amber-200/50'>
    <h2 class='text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-amber-900'>Recent Posts</h2>
    <ul class='space-y-3'>
      {% for post in collections.posts reversed %}
        <li class='hover:bg-amber-100/30 p-2 rounded transition-colors'>
          <a
            href='{{ post.url }}'
            class='text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 font-medium'
          >
            {{- post.data.title -}}
          </a>
          <small class='text-amber-600/70 ml-2'
            >({{ post.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }})</small
          >
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
